date":"2021-06-02T07:59:23-07:00","id":1450685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1414024#post1414024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wish these were still cannon rather than Gehenna's &amp;quot;Plot Device&amp;quot; mechanics. I've never understood the sentiment of giving the antediluvians &amp;quot;Basically true magic without paradox&amp;quot;.<br /> <br /> Even if certain NPCs are unkillable for setting reasons, they should still have weaknesses/limitations that allow the player to escape or even outmaneuver them without being rail-roaded.</div> </div> </div> </div>Most of these are just nine-dot powers instead. So they haven't disappeared.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-02T10:42:27-07:00","id":1450696,"title":"","content":"I believe the Daimonion one was stated to be a misprint and was only level nine. It was attempted by Shaitan twice and he is 4rth generation and hardly a Golconda-candidate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-02T19:41:55-07:00","id":1450768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trollroot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450696#post1450696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I believe the Daimonion one was stated to be a misprint and was only level nine. It was attempted by Shaitan twice and he is 4rth generation and hardly a Golconda-candidate.</div> </div> </div> </div>The level 10 version is in 2nd edition (Baali clanbook).<br /> <br /> Later its effect was lowered to 9.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-02T23:00:31-07:00","id":1450784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rock113</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450768#post1450768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The level 10 version is in 2nd edition (Baali clanbook).<br /> <br /> Later its effect was lowered to 9.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but theoretically, if Shaitan/Nergal (or another Baali elder) has attempted it, it would have to be a power that's available to him. It never made sense that it was a tenth-dot Discipline, since there is no Baali Antediluvian (unless Saulot is planning to open the way himself).<br /> <br /> So while it was always intended in 2e to be a level 10 power, that was a mistake if you take the setting into account.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-02T23:46:03-07:00","id":1450786,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450784#post1450784\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, but theoretically, if Shaitan/Nergal (or another Baali elder) has attempted it, it would have to be a power that's available to him. It never made sense that it was a tenth-dot Discipline, since there is no Baali Antediluvian (unless Saulot is planning to open the way himself).<br /> <br /> So while it was always intended in 2e to be a level 10 power, that was a mistake if you take the setting into account.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, even the level 10 stuff doesn\u2019t say he can\u2019t use it\u2026<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <br /> However, such is the intense formality of its use that it has become psychologically impossible to exercise this ability <b>without an extensive ritual to &quot;prepare&quot; the Opener.</b> In truth, Open the Way would function perfectly well without its trappings and folderol if performed by a Baali who did not believe in such, but seeing as none currently exist, the question is moot. </div> </div> </div>Level 10 may be not that inaccessible if you have additional preparation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","