ber/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T09:08:49-07:00","id":1450829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450802#post1450802\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not following your argument here. Level 10 Disciplines are only for Antediluvians and those who attain Golconda. No one else can use level 10 Disciplines because of the Generational maximums for anything less than an Antediluvian.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s what stuff says, I don\u2019t know VtM well, but I think some blood magic things may allow you use them\u2026 temporarily <br /> <br /> To your arguments in #11. Many settings change through versions. I think stuff says Shaitan uses its level 9 version is later than this 2nd one. Well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T09:48:27-07:00","id":1450838,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ethryo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450819#post1450819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am happy that V5 did not run with methuslaeh powers like these old books and v20 does. I can understand why all the powergamers i have met online and in RL prefer V1-v20 and why they oppose everything that is V5. But i am happy to have a vampire game that suit my gaming style.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">No Edition Warring on these forums or insults to playstyles.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T10:01:12-07:00","id":1450839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rock113</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450829#post1450829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That\u2019s what stuff says, I don\u2019t know VtM well, but I think some blood magic things may allow you use them\u2026 temporarily <br /> <br /> To your arguments in #11. Many settings change through versions. I think stuff says Shaitan uses its level 9 version is later than this 2nd one. Well?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh right, I see what you're getting at. I think there are rituals which can thicken the blood temporarily, and those might allow you to use powers above your level, but you'd have to maintain the increased blood potency (lower case) over the period in which you learn the Discipline, then pay the experience required, and finally perform the rite before your Generation drops back to what it was.<br /> <br /> As for previous and later versions of this power, I think it most likely was reduced to level 9 so it would be consistent with the lore. It's that very same book (Clanbook: Baali) which details the two major attempts to awaken/usher in the Children (or one of them, at any rate). So it was inconsistent even at the time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T10:12:03-07:00","id":1450841,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450839#post1450839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for previous and later versions of this power, I think it most likely was reduced to level 9 so it would be consistent with the lore. It's that very same book (Clanbook: Baali) which details the two major attempts to awaken/usher in the Children (or one of them, at any rate). So it was inconsistent even at the time.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don\u2019t think it\u2019s inconsistent, level 10 stuff says you can use it through rituals, and Shaitan may do so, to show how badass he is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T10:26:02-07:00","id":1450845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rock113</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450841#post1450841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don\u2019t think it\u2019s inconsistent, level 10 stuff says you can use it through rituals, and Shaitan may do so, to show how badass he is.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not, strictly speaking, a ritual, though. And I haven't seen the rule where you can use level 10 rituals if you can't use level 10 Disciplines. Can you tell me where that is? Is it in a Blood Magic book, perhaps?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T13:41:59-07:00","id":1450878,"title":"","content":"They got the number of dots wrong. Miscounted. Supposed to be nine dots. Its like they got that &quot;page XX&quot; thing all the time. 90s White Wolf were not all that great on proofing. They got asked ont he forums if that power meant there was a Baali antediluvian around. Note entirely impossible given the Moloch-Troile thing. And they said no, it was a miscount.<br /> <br /> I mean, it seems strong for a level 9 power even, but its not like it is without cost or like you get any cotrol. And it leverages a far more powerful entity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-03T23:11:03-07:00","id":1450916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trollroot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450878#post1450878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They got the number of dots wrong. Miscounted. Supposed to be nine dots. Its like they got that &amp;quot;page XX&amp;quot; thing all the time. 90s White Wolf were not all that great on proofing. They got asked ont he forums if that power meant there was a Baali antediluvian around. Note entirely impossible given the Moloch-Troile thing. And they said no, it was a miscount.<br /> <br /> I mean, it seems strong for a level 9 power even, but its not like it is without cost or like you get any cotrol. And it leverages a far more powerful entity.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I thought. And you do basically lose all your permanent WP, so it's balanced, I'd say. Also, the being that enters through your body can have whatever limitations (or not) your ST decides upon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-04T11:30:40-07:00","id":1450972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450916#post1450916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's what I thought. And you do basically lose all your permanent WP, so it's balanced, I'd say. Also, the being that enters through your body can have whatever limitations (or not) your ST decides upon.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Baali power is a \u201cyou commit psychic suicide so a demon can use your body as a meat suit\u201d power. It\u2019s not really a PC power, it\u2019s a plot device.<br /> <br /> That said, given the description of Shaitan being essentially a demon in a vampiric body it could be that his past efforts to enact the ritual didn\u2019t so much fail as just didn\u2019t have the effect expected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-05T00:35:23-07:00","id":1451025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1450972#post1450972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Baali power is a \u201cyou commit psychic suicide so a demon can use your body as a meat suit\u201d power. It\u2019s not really a PC power, it\u2019s a plot device.<br /> <br /> That said, given the description of Shaitan being essentially a demon in a vampiric body it could be that his past efforts to enact the ritual didn\u2019t so much fail as just didn\u2019t have the effect expected.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly. Hence why the ST can impose any limitations (or not) that they want to. I doubt any PC would want to use it, even if they could.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T19:18:45-07:00","id":1487090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blailton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1411175#post1411175\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Banishment is the winner I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is the only way to get rid of whoever has Vicissitude 10.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blailton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1411175#post1411175\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Reality is waaay weak. All the victim have to do is spend some willpower to full counter a antediluvian o.O</div> </div> </div> </div>But it could be a great reward, as it is the ultimate carrot: &quot;I can LITERALLY make all your dreams true&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T19:42:03-07:00","id":1487092,"title":"","content":"So the strongest is clearly Chimerstry, correct? Just target yourself with it and send yourself to an alternate universe where you are omniscient and omnipotent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-19T19:50:49-07:00","id":1487094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1487092#post1487092\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the strongest is clearly Chimerstry, correct? Just target yourself with it and send yourself to an alternate universe where you are omniscient and omnipotent.</div> </div> </div> </div>My thoughts exactly, but keeping the themes of the Curse, you should be able to send <b>others</b> there, never yourself.<br /> <br /> And the text clearly states that <i>&quot;This allows the illusion master to trap <b>another </b>in an alternate reality&quot;.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 06-30-2024, 04:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-08T15:14:41-07:00","id":1489506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1411167-all-level-10-disciplines-rituals-and-their-resources?p=1487090#post1487090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It is the only way to get rid of whoever has Vicissitude 10.<br /> <br /> <br /> But it could be a great reward, as it is the ultimate carrot: &quot;I can LITERALLY make all your dreams true&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>True. True.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-09T10:13:10-07:00","id":1489564,"title":"","content":"Wow, thanks for sharing! I never had the chance to look at the mechanical aspect of each of the 10th level power.<br /> <br /> And oh boy, they are all over the place!<br /> <br /> Some powers like, Animalism, Auspex, Dominate, Necromancy, Obfuscate, and presence seems strong, but are pretty interesting. I think i like to dominate the most. The only thing i dislike a bit about it is the mental link, which should, imo, is too \u2018\u2019Auspex-like\u2019\u2019.<br /> <br /> Daimonon 10th dot is just a plot device, so i wonder why make it a power. <br /> <br /> Obtenebration and Chemistry are very scary, but as 10th level power, i think they are fine.<br /> <br /> Vicissitude 10 just feels like Buu from Dragonball, but it guess it\u2019s also fine for a 10th-level discipline.<br /> <br /> Serpentis feels cool thematically, but mechanically it just feels plain weird. Why is it limited to attacking? Imagine the bearer of the mark of damnation walking into a daycare getting attacked by a bunch of children, or into a mall getting attacked by regular folks. IMO, it would work better if it made people shun the bearer instead of straight up attacking at all times.<br /> <br /> Thaumathurgy starts playing with things i think vampires should have never been able to deal with. The Sun and fire are supposed to be a weakness, having a power completely nullify it just feels wrong to me. At worst, it should have been a fortitude power instead. Then again, i might be a hypocrite, cause i\u2019m ifne with Requiem's mystery of the ascendant.<br /> <br /> I had heard of protean 10 before, and while it\u2019s weaker than what i had been told, this one is just plain silly to me.<br /> <br /> Valeren and Obeah feel okay thematically, but kinda weak. I can see the appeal thematically, but it\u2019s so limited and situational that it just feels pretty \u2018\u2019meh\u2019\u2019. I just can\u2019t see an Antediluvian really caring about resurrecting mortals.<br /> <br /> Finally, Quietus. That one made me laugh out loud, it is so unbearably weak compared to the others. There's an indestructible vampire, a vampire commanding animal armies, a vampire with a will so strong they can rewrite someone else whole personality, a vampire able to banish someone into literal oblivion, and then there\u2019s a vampire who\u2019s mildly better at blood bounding\u2026 In Requiem, this power is available to an Ordo Dracul with the 3rd dot of the mystery of the Voivode, which means a character could start with it.<br /> <br /> Anyway, thanks for sharing, that was a fun read!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26771-algarik","name":"Algarik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26771_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"115"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-09T11:52:47-07:00","id":1489572,"title":"","content":"Some of these powers are so over the top! I love it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-10T02:47:20-07:00","id":1489615,"title":"","content":"Many are, frankly, not very well-designed and/or just feel &quot;weird&quot; and should be lower level powers (and some in fact became level 9 or 8 powers). I'm glad 3rd edition made level 10 powers plot devices, one of the few things 3rd edition got right...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}